    "Replace, don't just block. One new habit chosen every morning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remplacer, pas seulement bloquer. Une nouvelle habitude choisie chaque matin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"I am someone who…\" Shorter calls, harder questions. League unlocked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Je suis quelqu'un qui… » Appels plus courts, questions plus dures. Ligue débloquée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A 15-minute daily window opens. Stick tests if you can hold it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une fenêtre de 15 min par jour s'ouvre. Stick teste si tu la tiens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scaffolding comes off. One call a day. You plan life after day 75.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'échafaudage tombe. Un appel par jour. Tu planifies l'après-75."
