        }
      }
    },
    "I want them back": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je veux les récupérer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "75 days. Your voice. Your life.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "75 jours. Ta voix. Ta vie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What if your own voice called you to stop?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Et si ta propre voix t'appelait pour t'arrêter ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stick clones your voice. It calls you in the morning for your goals, the second you open TikTok, and at night for the debrief. You can ignore anyone. Not yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stick clone ta voix. Elle t'appelle le matin pour tes objectifs, à la seconde où tu ouvres TikTok, et le soir pour le bilan. Tu peux ignorer n'importe qui. Pas toi-même."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "7:00 · Wake-up call": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "7:00 · Appel du réveil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"Up. Give me three goals. Real ones.\"": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Debout. Donne-moi trois objectifs. Des vrais. »"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "14:12 · You open TikTok": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "14:12 · Tu ouvres TikTok"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"You promised me this morning. Close it. Yes or no?\"": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Tu m'as promis ce matin. Ferme. Oui ou non ? »"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "21:30 · Debrief": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "21:30 · Bilan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"What did you actually do today?\"": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Qu'est-ce que tu as vraiment fait aujourd'hui ? »"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hear an example": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écouter un exemple"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which apps steal your time?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quelles apps te volent ton temps ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick everything that applies. Stick blocks and intercepts these.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coche tout ce qui s'applique. Stick bloque et intercepte celles-là."
          }
        }
      }
    },
