    "Nothing yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien pour l'instant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In 75 days you get back": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En 75 jours tu récupères"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's what your %@ hours a day are worth. Here's what people do with them:": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C'est ce que valent tes %@ heures par jour. Voilà ce que les gens en font :"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "books read cover to cover": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "livres lus en entier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "45-minute runs": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "runs de 45 minutes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "full work weeks on your project": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "semaines de travail pleines sur ton projet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "full nights of sleep": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "nuits complètes de sommeil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let's get them": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allons les chercher"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who do you want to be on day 75?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qui veux-tu être au jour 75 ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One sentence. Your own voice will say it back to you every time you drift.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une phrase. Ta propre voix te la répétera à chaque fois que tu dérives."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Someone who finishes what he starts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quelqu'un qui finit ce qu'il commence."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What should Stick call you?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comment Stick doit t'appeler ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your first name. It's the first word you'll hear every morning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton prénom. C'est le premier mot que tu entendras chaque matin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First name": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prénom"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why your voice?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pourquoi ta voix ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can hang up on a coach. You can't hang up on yourself. Stick clones your voice so every call is you, talking to you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu peux raccrocher au nez d'un coach. Pas au tien. Stick clone ta voix pour que chaque appel soit toi, qui te parles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You read a 60-second script. That's the only recording we use.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu lis un script de 60 secondes. C'est le seul enregistrement qu'on utilise."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sample is sent to Fish Audio, our voice-cloning provider, to build a private synthetic voice. It is never shared or made public.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'échantillon est envoyé à Fish Audio, notre fournisseur de clonage vocal, pour créer une voix synthétique privée. Elle n'est jamais partagée ni rendue publique."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only your own voice. Never someone else's. Stick refuses any other recording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uniquement ta propre voix. Jamais celle d'un autre. Stick refuse tout autre enregistrement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete the clone any time from Me › My voice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supprime le clone à tout moment depuis Moi › Ma voix."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I consent to cloning my own voice and to sending my recording to Fish Audio for that purpose.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je consens au clonage de ma propre voix et à l'envoi de mon enregistrement à Fish Audio dans ce but."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Record my voice": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enregistrer ma voix"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read this. Naturally.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lis ça. Naturellement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read this out loud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lis ça à voix haute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About 60 seconds. Speak like you'd talk to a friend. Quiet room, phone at normal distance.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Environ 60 secondes. Parle comme à un ami. Pièce calme, téléphone à distance normale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep going · %lld s more": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continue · encore %lld s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Microphone access is off. Enable it in Settings › Stick to record.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'accès au micro est désactivé. Active-le dans Réglages › Stick pour enregistrer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use this recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utiliser cet enregistrement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start recording": {
