    "Delete everything": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout supprimer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deletes your account, league score, progress, goals, calls and voice clone. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supprime ton compte, ton score de ligue, ta progression, tes objectifs, tes appels et ton clone vocal. Irréversible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your league is filling up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta ligue se remplit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thirty people, ranked every week on hours recovered. Invite a friend: they get 5 free days, you get someone to beat.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trente personnes, classées chaque semaine sur les heures récupérées. Invite un ami : il a 5 jours gratuits, tu as quelqu'un à battre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After day 75": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après le jour 75"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stick Life keeps the calls, opens new seasons and the leagues. Have a look before the end.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stick Life garde les appels, ouvre de nouvelles saisons et les ligues. Jette un œil avant la fin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shield comes off: 15 minutes a day, on your honor. Stick still calls every time you open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
